    justification:  # ba5d
    description: "Java extracts full annotation metadata into meta.decorators (name, args, kwargs), enabling YAML framework pattern enrichment for Spring @GetMapping, JPA @Entity, etc. Kotlin has no annotation extraction at all. This blocks Spring Boot Kotlin framework detection. Also affects Scala and Groovy. Fix: add annotation extraction to kotlin.py, scala.py, groovy.py analogous to Java's implementation."  # ba5d
